A note on the original SLAB -- see also THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

This project is an independent reimplementation of the SLAB model described in

    Ermak, D.L. (1990) User's Manual for SLAB: An Atmospheric Dispersion Model
    for Denser-than-Air Releases. UCRL-MA-105607, Lawrence Livermore National
    Laboratory.

No part of the original source is included here. That source carries a
non-commercial restriction of its own -- it may not be distributed as part of
any commercial product, and no fee may be charged for distributing it -- which
is incompatible with the licence above. Users who want to run the comparison
harness obtain the original themselves; see golden/fortran/README.md.
